+	/*
+	 * Minimal RTAS compatibility for classic Mac OS.  Mac OS requires the
+	 * standard tokens to exist before its native CUDA and PCI drivers take
+	 * over.  NVRAM is exposed directly in the device tree, so acknowledge its
+	 * RTAS transfer calls with zero bytes; unsupported services report a
+	 * hardware error and let Mac OS use its native driver instead.
